dbt2-extensions (0.62.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bump DBT-2 kit to 0.62.0 and extension SQL to 0.46.0.
  * Rebase the PG_CONFIG and reproducible-path patch.
  * Preserve legacy function OIDs, dependencies, ACLs and comments while
    exposing the expanded 0.46 result rows through compatibility wrappers.
  * Preserve function strictness and bind compatibility calls independently
    of the caller search path while retaining extension relocatability.
  * Update the copyright year.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:02:06 +0800

dbt2-extensions (0.61.7-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package for the DBT-2 PostgreSQL C stored functions.
  * Build version-specific packages for PostgreSQL 14 through 18.
  * Keep upstream SQL extension version 0.45.0 distinct from kit version.
  * Honor pg_buildext's PG_CONFIG for correct per-version ABI builds.
  * Preserve reproducible paths in LLVM bitcode and generate shlib dependencies.
  * Verify source integrity and generate automatic debug symbols.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 21:50:00 +0800
